ine's electricity generation capabilities would power the induction heating surfaces to boiling temperatures. As the water reaches boiling temperatures as it drops from the penstock into the hydro turbine, it's expansion would increase the turbine speed at much greater velocities that the water would without expansion. This design is something that was developed from turbochargers used in automobiles.","topics":[],"score":213915,"global_rank":251211},{"name":"matsen/constnj","owner":"matsen","html_url":"https://github.com/matsen/constnj","stars":2,"forks":0,"watchers":2,"issues":0,"language":"OCaml","description":"Code to accompany \"constNJ: an Algorithm to Reconstruct Sets of Phylogenetic Trees Satisfying Pairwise Topological Constraints\"","topics":[],"score":213913,"global_rank":251214},{"name":"kakearney/ecopathsankey-pkg","owner":"kakearney","html_url":"https://github.com/kakearney/ecopathsankey-pkg","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"MATLAB","description":"Create JSON file for use with d3 Ecopath sankey diagrams","topics":[],"score":213912,"global_rank":251218},{"name":"alexquincy/ornate-bonzai","owner":"alexquincy","html_url":"https://github.com/alexquincy/ornate-bonzai","stars":2,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":null,"topics":[],"score":213911,"global_rank":251233},{"name":"kmjson/System_15","owner":"kmjson","html_url":"https://github.com/kmjson/System_15","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"C","description":"System Level Programming - Work#15","topics":[],"score":213908,"global_rank":251239},{"name":"aabdin02/MNISTFashion","owner":"aabdin02","html_url":"https://github.com/aabdin02/MNISTFashion","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Matlab","description":null,"topics":[],"score":213908,"global_rank":251241},{"name":"sak797/distributed-trie","owner":"sak797","html_url":"https://github.com/sak797/distributed-trie","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language"